// Generated diagnostic helper; excluded from production builds.
// ===========================================================================================================================================================
// AUTHOR               : Charles Korthout
// CREATE DATE          : 13 November 2026
// PURPOSE              : Record bounded copied-runner case costs without changing case outcomes.
// SPECIAL NOTES        : Diagnostic only; process CPU includes all threads and observer overhead is unmeasured.
